# tool-repos — rules for one kind of repo, layered on the base set.
#
# Order is reading order. Every fragment listed here ships in
# rule-sets/tool-repos.md; one that is not listed ships nowhere, and the build says so.

title: Tool Repo Rules
blurb: For repos whose product is a tool an agent drives.
layer: ai-rules

rule: tool-repos/agent-contract
rule: tool-repos/thin-hosts
rule: tool-repos/parallel-safety
rule: tool-repos/dogfooding
skill: refresh-tool-surface
